 "_README": [
  "Index of the 39 NLM Visible Human Project DICOM series as mirrored by the NCI Imaging Data Commons (collection nlm_visible_human_project, IDC data release v15).",
  "A KEY, not data: series UUID -> modality, description, subject (VHP-M male / VHP-F female), matrix, slice thickness and pixel spacing, read from the first DICOM of each series. It carries no anatomy and no geometry.",
  "Objects are served anonymously from gs://idc-open-data/<UUID>/ (scripts/download_idc_series.py). The frozen-CT series 5d409385 (head to proximal femur, arms included), 145c2668 (pelvis to ankle) and 94755b62 (feet) are the ones ingested; see docs/GEOMETRY_SOURCES.md."
